"Comparison and Resources <../comparison>`."

#: ../../source/products/models/index.rst:7
msgid ":doc:`HM-D20-4G <hm-d20-4g>`：轻量化 4G/CORS 一体化 RTK 接收机。"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HM-D20-4G <hm-d20-4g>`: Lightweight integrated RTK GNSS receiver with "
"4G/CORS."

#: ../../source/products/models/index.rst:8
msgid ""
":doc:`HM-D20-LoRa <hm-d20-lora>`：D20 移动站与 D13 基站组成的 LoRa RTK 套件。"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HM-D20-LoRa <hm-d20-lora>`: LoRa RTK kit with a D20 rover and D13 base "
"station."

#: ../../source/products/models/index.rst:9
msgid ""
":doc:`HM-D13-4G <hm-d13-4g>`：面向地面移动作业的紧凑型 4G/CORS RTK 接收机。"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HM-D13-4G <hm-d13-4g>`: Compact 4G/CORS RTK receiver for ground "
"operations."

#: ../../source/products/models/index.rst:10
msgid ""
":doc:`HM-D13-LoRa <hm-d13-lora>`：D13 移动站与 D13 基站组成的 LoRa RTK 套件。"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HM-D13-LoRa <hm-d13-lora>`: LoRa RTK kit with a D13 rover and D13 base "
"station."

#: ../../source/products/models/index.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`HM-G51B <hm-g51b>`：单频多星座 GNSS 接收机模组。"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HM-G51B <hm-g51b>`: Single-band multi-constellation GNSS receiver "
"module."

